        "sid": "ACT 4"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "4",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Petro na Johane kughenjwa mwandunyi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao iji Petro na Johane werekoghe wikidedanya na wandu, wikachelwa ni wakohani na m'baa wa walindiri wa Hekalu, na Masadukayo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nawo werekoghe wazamilwa na ndighi, angu awo wadumi wawi werekoghe wikiwichilia wandu malagho gha kuruka kwa Jesu na angu wafu wicharuka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wikawiwada na kuwirughia nyumbenyi wilindilo hata nakesho, angu erekoghe luma lwa kenyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela wengi wa awo weresikireghe ilagho, wikarumiria; na mtalo ghwa womi ghukavika sa elfu isanu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.4.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakesho yaro, wabaa wa Wayahudi, waghosi, na walimu wa Sharia, wikakwana chiaimweri Jerusalemu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "andwamweri na Anasi Mkohani M'baa, na Kayafa, na Johane, na Alekizanda chiaimweri na wandu wazima wose wa kichuku cha Mkohani M'baa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hata iji wawireda na kuwiwika wadumi aghadi kwawo, wikawikotia, “Ni kwa ndighi riao angu kwa irina jani mwabonya ilagho iji?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko Petro ukichulwa ni Roho Mweli ukawitumbulia, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Wabaa wa wandu na waghosi, ngera dakotelwa idime malagho gha ibonyo icha jibonyero kwa mkelemeri seji uboisiro, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ndejimanyike konyu na kwa Waisraeli wose kukaia, kwa irina ja Jesu Kristo wa Nazareti, uo moremsulubishireghe, nao moni Mlungu ukamrukisha kufuma kwa wafu, kwa uo, mundu uhu oko kimusi imbiri konyu uboisiro putu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uhu Jesu nuo ughorelo ni Maandiko Ghielie huwu:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.4.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao iji waghuwona wuwana ghwa Petro na Johane, na kumanya seji ni wandu wa kawaida wisena kishomo chingi, wikashinika; wikawitambua kukaia ni wandu werekwanyeghe na Jesu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela wikimmbona uja mundu uboisiro ukwanye nawo, ndeweredimieghe kughora ilagho jingi ja kuwitangala anduangi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hata iji wawifunya shighadi ya mwandu, wikabonya njama weni na weni wikighamba, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Awandu diwibonya wada? Kwa kukaia wandu wose wikaiagha Jerusalemu wamanya angu ihi alama mbaa niwo weni waibonya, nesi ndedidimagha kuikana anduangi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.4.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela eri dighirie ilagho iji jiseere kwa wandu wazima, diwikanie wiseghore na mndungi putu kwa irina ja Jesu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.4.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko wikawiwanga wingie; wikawikania wiseghore putu hata kufundisha kwa irina ja Jesu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.4.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 4:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela Petro na Johane wikawitumbulia, “Tanyenyi mmbeni ngera ni hachi imbiri ya Mlungu kumsikira inyo kuchumba uo moni; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.4.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.4.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 4:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ela isi ndedichaaleka kughora malagho dighiwonie na kughisikira anduangi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.4.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.4.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 4:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nawo wiendawizera malagho ghewikumba wowa, wikawifungua. Wikasowa chia ingi ewitirira, angu wandu wose werekoghe wikimkasa Mlungu kwa iro maza rerebonyekieghe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.4.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.4.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 4:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uo mundu oreboisiroghe orekoghe wachumba irika ja miaka mirongo ina.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.4.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.4.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Warumirii kulomba wuwana",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 4:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.4.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.4.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 4:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao iji wameria kufungulwa, wikawighendia wambao na kuwighoria seji werezereloghe ni wakohani wabaa na waghosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.4.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.4.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 4:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nawo iji wasikira agho, wikamlomba Mlungu chiaimweri kwa chwaka rawo wikighamba, “Ee Bwana, Muumbi mlungunyi na ndoenyi na bahari na vose viko andenyi yaro;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.4.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.4.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.20.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kuf. 20.11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NEH.9.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Neh. 9.6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.146.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zab. 146.6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.4.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.4.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 4:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kwa momu ghwa aba odu Daudi mdumiki wako, koreghorieghe kwa Roho Mweli:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.4.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.4.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Wungara kwa warumirii",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 4:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.4.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.4.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 4:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wandu wose wererumirieghe werekoghe na nia imweri na roho imweri, hata mndungi ndereghorieghe wei kindo chingi ni chake moni uekeri anduangi; ela werekoghe na wungara ghwa vilambo vose.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.4.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.4.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.2.44+ACT.2.45"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mab. 2.44-45",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.4.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.4.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 4:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wadumi wikashuhudia kwa ndighi mbaa malagho gha kuruka kwa Bwana Jesu, na mvono mungi ghorekoghe aighu kwawo wose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.4.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.4.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 4:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hata ndekorekoghe na mndungi aghadi kwawo oresowieghe kindo chingi; angu wose werekoghe na ndoe, angu nyumba, wereriuzireghe wikareda pesa ra ivo vilambo vereuziroghe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
